{"abstract":"Caching posting lists can reduce the amount of disk I/O required to evaluate a query. Current methods use optimisation procedures for maximising the cache hit ratio. A recent method selects posting lists for static caching in a greedy manner and obtains higher hit rates than standard cache eviction policies such as LRU and LFU. However, a greedy method does not formally guarantee an optimal solution. We investigate whether the use of methods guaranteed, in theory, to and an approximately optimal solution would yield higher hit rates. Thus, we cast the selection of posting lists for caching as an integer linear programming problem and perform a series of experiments using heuristics from combinatorial optimisation (CCO) to nd optimal solutions. Using simulated query logs we nd that CCO yields comparable results to a greedy baseline using cache sizes between 200 and 1000 MB, with modest improvements for queries of length two to three.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Petersen, Casper","Simonsen, Jakob Grue","Lioma, Christina"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-533222"],"event":{"acronym":"AIRS","end":"2015-12-04","place":"Brisbane, au","start":"2015-12-02","title":"Asia Information Retrieval Societies Conference","year":"2015"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the impact of using combinatorial optimisation for static caching of posting lists","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/162751796/airs_cache_cr_70.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-533222","identifier":[{"id":"84958087862","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-ea0d7a5d-a96f-49fc-bbd4-8e15beef4436"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-51FC82B6CEF3B6430D60E41E3514D056"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/162751796/airs_cache_cr_70.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Computer Science, Department of Computer Science","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Computer Science, The Image Section"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Casper","key":"petersenpau","last":"Petersen","locid":"b3f33831-f74d-423e-ab97-6e864f3ecc89","name":"Petersen, Casper","orcid":"0000-0001-5858-1985","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Jakob Grue","key":"simonsenpau","last":"Simonsen","locid":"833c3e76-0bbe-4624-b1a9-9f0764fa69d0","name":"Simonsen, Jakob Grue","orcid":"0000-0002-3488-9392","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Christina","key":"liomapau","last":"Lioma","locid":"f05aae41-ef94-4bb6-8562-8abb5e760f42","name":"Lioma, Christina","orcid":"0000-0003-2600-2701","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Guido","key":"zucconpedh","last":"Zuccon","name":"Zuccon, Guido","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Shlomo","key":"gevapedh","last":"Geva","name":"Geva, Shlomo","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Hideo","key":"johopedh","last":"Joho","name":"Joho, Hideo","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Fa