{"abstract":"We investigate the distribution of digits of large prefixes of the expansion of irrational algebraic numbers to different bases. We compute 2.318 bits of the binary expansions (corresponding to 2.33.108 decimals) of the 39 least Pisot-Vijayaraghavan numbers, the 47 least known Salem numbers, the least 20 square roots of positive integers that are not perfect squares, and 15 randomly generated algebraic irrationals. We employ these to compute the generalized serial statistics (roughly, the variant of the χ2-statistic apt for distribution of sequences of characters) of the distributions of digit blocks for each number to bases 2, 3, 5, 7 and 10, as well as the maximum relative frequency deviation from perfect equidistribution. We use the two statistics to perform tests at significance level α = 0.05, respectively, maximum deviation threshold α = 0.05. Our results suggest that if Borel's conjecture-that all irrational algebraic numbers are normal-is true, then it may have an empirical base: The distribution of digits in algebraic numbers appears close to equidistribution for large prefixes of their expansion. Of the 121 algebraic numbers studied, all numbers passed the maximum relative frequency deviation test in all considered bases for digit block sizes 1, 2, 3, and 4; furthermore, 92 numbers passed all tests up to block size 4 in all bases considered.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Nielsen, Johan Sejr Brinch","Simonsen, Jakob Grue"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-034989"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"an experimental investigation of the normality of irrational algebraic numbers","src":["dtu","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/80582151/S0025_5718_2013_02675_0.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-034989","identifier":[{"id":"84878166803","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-6868ffc0-8ff8-49b2-81f4-567403bdcde9","ku-47ff4b31-1c00-472e-a17f-10c46838ab27"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-3E5C1DF9E2DF095B20FC2E07C3760E44"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/80582151/S0025_5718_2013_02675_0.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Physics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Computer Science, Department of Computer Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Johan Sejr Brinch","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"2a7f54e1-7b6c-41be-9bed-d3c024d13026","name":"Nielsen, Johan Sejr Brinch","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Jakob Grue","key":"simonsenpau","last":"Simonsen","locid":"833c3e76-0bbe-4624-b1a9-9f0764fa69d0","name":"Simonsen, Jakob Grue","orcid":"0000-0002-3488-9392","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1090/s0025-5718-2013-02675-0","issn":["00255718","10886842"],"issn_org":["00255718"],"issue":"283","journal":"Mathematics of Computation","pages":"1837-1858","publisher":"American Mathematical Society","status":"p","title":"Mathematics of Computation","volume":"82"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84878166803"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-6868ffc0-8ff8-49b2-81f4-567403bdcde9","ku-47ff4b31-1c00-472e-a17f-10c46838ab27"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"An experimental investigation of the normality of irrational algebraic numbers.","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-034989","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
